                                                "sense_id": "d3b19a29-4bf0-3e2a-9a73-aba9a04535b7",
                                                "text": "THICK FLUFFY ICING\nAt the present time there is a demand for very light fluffy icing that may be piled high on a cake. For beating many of the icings of this variety an electric beater is used, and the syrup is added very slowly."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
